sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  actor P as Provider
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  C->>API: POST /requirements
  API->>DB: requirement active, answers, outbox
  P->>API: GET /leads?category&location
  API->>DB: Match categories and area, require lead access
  API-->>P: Leads with contact details hidden
  P->>API: POST /requirements/:id/interest
  API->>DB: Insert interest (unique), outbox
  API-->>C: Notification
  C->>API: POST /interests/:id/accept
  API->>DB: Transaction: interest accepted, connection, conversation, members, outbox
  API-->>P: Notification
  API-->>C: Conversation ID
